 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Defined past",
   "texto": [
    "To count a finished action, add **-dı/-di/-du/-dü** or, after deaf consonant, **-tı/-ti/-tu/-tü**. Then the person is added: **geldim** (vine), **gittim** (I went), **izledim** (vi).",
    "**Dün** means yesterday; **geçen hafta** means last week.",
    "Informal question: **Ne yaptın?** = what did you do? The verb **yapmak** (do) has a frequent irregular form: **yaptım** (did)."
   ]
  },
